seg-02110864419e = This document collects the structural and behavioural diagrams. §{ "1" } is the sensor-pack core; §1a maps the astrodynamics, fusion, and alt-PNT layers added since; §1b–§1d the study, domain and output layers. For usage see the <a1>README</a1>; for what is and isn't validated see <a2>VALIDATION</a2>; for the per-capability maturity table see <a3>CAPABILITY</a3>.

