seg-8a8e1b93b704 = The astrodynamics, fusion, and alt-PNT layers in §1a — the full SGP4/SDP4 propagator, the numerical Cowell propagator with its seven-perturbation force model and two adaptive integrators, maneuver/trajectory design, orbit determination, the 15-/8-/17-state GNSS/INS estimators, the coupled clock+position filter, and gravity-map matching — have all shipped, alongside the Security FoM with an active spoof demonstrator, real TLE/multi-constellation geometry, Monte-Carlo bands, trade-study sweeps, the printable HTML (HyperText Markup Language) report with its machine-readable twin, and the release/publish/wheels/pages workflows.

